{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"耶利米書","commonName":"耶利米書","title":"耶利米書","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"681b5a173916e28ae5f3b5c6bb5d16263b7d167f21a486ef3c62ed1ab29150f3","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1352},"chapter":{"number":12,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶利米的抱怨"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和華啊，每次我與你爭論，",{"text":"都顯明你是對的。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"然而，我還是和你討論公正：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為什麼惡人總是得勢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為什麼詭詐之人反而生活安逸？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你栽培他們，讓他們生根長大，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"結出果實。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們嘴上尊崇你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"心卻遠離你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但耶和華啊，你認識我，瞭解我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"察驗我是否一心向你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你拖走他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就像拖走待宰的羊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"留到宰殺之日。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大地哀慟、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"田野的植物枯槁要到何時呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"由於這地方居民的罪惡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"野獸和飛鳥都滅絕了。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們說：「上帝看不見我們的行為","poem":1},{"noteId":3},{"text":"。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華說：「如果你與步行的人競走，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"尚且感到疲乏，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又怎能與馬賽跑呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如果你在安全之地尚且跌倒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在約旦河邊的叢林中又會怎樣呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就連你的弟兄和家人都背叛了你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"叫囂著與你為敵。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"任他們甜言蜜語，你不要相信。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"「我已離開我的殿，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"撇棄我的產業，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把我愛的子民交給他們的敵人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的產業像林中的獅子一樣向我吼叫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此我憎惡他們；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的產業就像一隻帶斑點的鷙鳥，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被其他鷙鳥圍攻。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"去招聚一切野獸來吞吃牠吧！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列國的首領毀壞我的葡萄園，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"踐踏我美好的土地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使之淪為荒涼的曠野。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們使這片土地荒涼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"荒涼之地在我面前哀哭。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"遍地如此荒涼，卻無人在意。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毀滅者已上到曠野中光禿的山嶺，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華的刀劍橫掃全境，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無人可以平安穩妥。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的子民播種麥子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卻收割荊棘；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"辛勤耕耘，卻一無所獲。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因耶和華的烈怒，他們必收獲羞辱。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["耶和華說：「邪惡的鄰國侵佔了我賜給我以色列子民的土地，我要將他們從本土連根拔起，我要將猶大家從他們中間連根拔起。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["我將他們連根拔起以後，還要再憐憫他們，把他們帶回各自的家園和故土。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["如果他們真心學習我子民的信仰，憑永活的耶和華之名起誓，正如他們教導我子民憑巴力起誓一樣，他們必歸入我的子民中。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["如果哪一國不聽我的話，我必把它連根拔起，徹底毀滅。這是耶和華說的。」"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":3,"caller":"+","text":"「上帝看不見我們的行為」參照《七十士譯本》，希伯來文也可譯作「他（指耶利米）看不見我們的結局」。","reference":{"chapter":12,"verse":4}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/12.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/13.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/11.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}